gag_(){return"This app stores all data exclusively locally on your device. On Android and iOS the database is stored encrypted; its key lives in the system's protected storage. The web app is a supported target; its browser storage (OPFS/IndexedDB) is not encrypted by the app. Export regularly \u2014 the export is the only backup. There are no servers, no cloud, no analytics services. Your data is never sent \u2014 not even on a crash or an error. Data leaves the device only when you yourself create and share an export/backup file. No personal data is transmitted to third parties. You can exercise your GDPR rights (e.g. access, deletion) directly within the app: view via Settings \u203a Export, deletion via Delete data, restore via Import."},
